  "role": "Finite owned legacy initial-focus/private-field repair; source evidence, not complete dialog qualification",
  "implementation": "Replace the cast into current CDK private focus/destroy/selector fields with an owned initial-focus helper using the public FocusTrapFactory.create(element,true), FocusTrap.focusInitialElement/destroy, InteractivityChecker and Renderer2. The enclosing container retains the real tab trap; temporary selector traps create no anchors. Preserve microtask focus, original global open-shadow active-element resolution, defaults/heading/custom selectors, FocusOptions and notification order. Own the destroyed guard and notification subject; its assigned public stream retains the inherited Observable-only type. Remove temporary forced-tabindex listeners on blur/mousedown, recapture and destroy, including finally cleanup when the parent destroy path throws.",
